msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Uwaaagh! Now, let's be reasonable about this,\r\n"
"gentlemen! ...Please don't kill me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"You came here to kill, and now you're beggin' for your life?\r\n"
"Pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Forgive us! These were our aniki's orders! Yeah! We were\r\n"
"just doin' our jobs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"...Then go. I'm through with the yakuza. I don't wanna\r\n"
"get blood on my hands no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to cause you all this\r\n"
"trouble..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Everyone causes some kind of trouble to somebody. If you\r\n"
"think you've been a burden, then balance it out by being\r\n"
"good to somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "That's... gonna take some work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"But. If somebody is willin' to have me work for them,\r\n"
"all I can say is I'm grateful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Glad to have you on board. Hopefully you can stay under the\r\n"
"radar at this place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"It's in a building on Park Boulevard. Here, I'll give you the\r\n"
"number. You can go there whenever you're ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I owe you one. Well, I'll be seeing you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Who are you? I told you not to come back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"(If he's in the yakuza business, it might just be quicker to\r\n"
"tell him my name.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for bouncers for a casino, so I came here to\r\n"
"recruit you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"...You screwin' with me? What does some goddamn casino have\r\n"
"to do with anything!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "You know what, why don't you just get the hell outta here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "I'm Kiryu. Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Kazuma... Kiryu? Wait... you mean, the fourth chairman of\r\n"
"the Tojo Clan!? That Kazuma Kiryu!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Well shit... I'm Shuichi Nanba. Sorry, but I'm not exactly\r\n"
"at liberty to tell you the name of my family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Because you want to get out of that life?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Yeah... Going into detail would only cause more problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Matter of fact, all I ever done in the yakuza was cause\r\n"
"people problems... and I don't wanna do that no more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Actually, I wanted to talk to you about something. Right now\r\n"
"I'm looking for some bouncers for a casino."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"The place is being targeted by some yakuza right now, so I\r\n"
"thought it'd be a good idea to have you on board. You seem\r\n"
"like you could handle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "But... the yakuza are after me, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"I don't see that as an issue. As they say, the enemy of my\r\n"
"enemy is my friend. Maybe you're just the guy we need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Maybe so... I doubt I can get any other form of employment,\r\n"
"legitimate or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Well then..."
msgstr "Bene, allora..."

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"We got you now, Nanba! So this is where you been hiding\r\n"
"out, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"And what do we got here? A fuckin' pain in the ass, that's\r\n"
"what... Guess we'll just take care of both of you at once!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Watch out, Kiryu-san. These guys don't mess around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"They sure don't look like the types who listen to reason...\r\n"
"This kind you have to teach with your fists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"What did you say!? Ohhh, you're dead now! We're gonna toss\r\n"
"both of your fuckin' corpses into Tokyo Bay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Kiryu. Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "I'm here to recruit you."
msgstr ""

